  "solution": "**Calculation:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/015e8e4c9475a69a4a358aaaf4c9a1b3563fb59556b87b7e0b63d56fd382105d.png] \n\n∠C = 30° + 20° = 50°\n\nIn ΔACD \n\n∠ACD + ∠CDA + ∠CAD = 180°\n\n⇒50° + ∠CDA +30° = 180°\n\n⇒ ∠CDA = 180° - 80°\n\n⇒∠CDA = 100°\n\n∠CDA + ∠ADB = 180° \n\n⇒∠ADB = 180° - 100° = 80°\n\n**Correct Answer: 3)80°**",
